{"id":"39ca6db73742d314","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Locally Connected Point","display":"df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point — ZFC Topo11 Locally Connected Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point — ZFC Topo11 Locally Connected Point","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top3-locally-connected-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-locally-connected-point — ZFC Topo11 Locally Connected Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c347796153b0ec02\" href=\"?note=c347796153b0ec02\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space\">58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"884abfbae28c27e3\" href=\"?note=884abfbae28c27e3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top3-locally-connected-space\">58-df-zfc-top3-locally-connected-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\">\\(X,\\tau\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S\\)</span> (connected-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c347796153b0ec02\" href=\"?note=c347796153b0ec02\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space\">58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11LocallyConnectedPoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11LocallyConnectedPoint}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}locally\\text{-}connected\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11LocallyConnectedPoint}_S(x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in V\\land V\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S(V,\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau\\})))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}locally\\text{-}connected\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11LocallyConnectedPoint}_S(x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to\\exists V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in V\\land V\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S(V,\\{O\\cap V:O\\in\\tau\\})))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary local connectedness definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space","status":"resolved","id":"c347796153b0ec02","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top3-locally-connected-space","status":"resolved","id":"884abfbae28c27e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top3-locally-connected-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space","status":"resolved","id":"c347796153b0ec02","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S$ (connected-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading"